{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Booking Terms — Hakkachan{% endblock %}
{% block meta_description %}Hakkachan's booking terms.{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <section class="py-24 md:py-32">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6">
            <p class="brand-mark text-xs text-brass mb-6 text-center">Legal</p>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light mb-12 text-charcoal text-center">Booking Terms</h1>

            <div class="space-y-8 text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="brand-mark text-sm text-charcoal mb-2">Reservations &amp; Payment</h2>
                    <p>A reservation is confirmed only once payment is completed at the time of booking. Each seating is priced at RM230 per person, minimum 2 pax, covering the full seven-course set menu.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="brand-mark text-sm text-charcoal mb-2">Cancellations &amp; Refunds</h2>
                    <p>All sales are final. Bookings are not refundable, but are instead transferable to another party in the event that you are unable to attend.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="brand-mark text-sm text-charcoal mb-2">Seating</h2>
                    <p>Seatings run Fridays and Saturdays at Intasek, 11 Jalan Tasek, 58100 Kuala Lumpur. Please arrive between 6:00pm–8:00pm.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="brand-mark text-sm text-charcoal mb-2">Late Arrival</h2>
                    <p>Since the set menu is served to the whole table together, we can hold your seat for up to 30 minutes after the seating begins. After that, we may need to release it to keep the evening on schedule for other guests. Payment remains non-refundable in this case.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="brand-mark text-sm text-charcoal mb-2">BYOB</h2>
                    <p>Guests are welcome to bring their own wine or spirits. Corkage is RM50 per bottle; mixers are available for purchase on site.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="brand-mark text-sm text-charcoal mb-2">Questions</h2>
                    <p>
                        For questions about an existing booking, message us on
                        <a href="https://wa.me/60127882550" class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-charcoal">WhatsApp</a>.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
{% endblock %}
